{"ID":"20230927143334-xzyrho1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927143334-xzyrho1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143334-xzyrho1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143339-gr7sfet\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143339-2jzt6oq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143339-2jzt6oq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:47,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:47\u0026#125;","title":"【大陷胸汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927143339"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927143339-gr7sfet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143339-gr7sfet","updated":"20230927143339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陷胸汤证："}]},{"ID":"20230927143339-5x44ijj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143339-5x44ijj","updated":"20230927143339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳病，阳浮而动数，浮则为风，数则为热，动则为痛，头痛发热，微盗汗出，而反恶寒者，表未解者。医反下之，动数变迟，膈内拒痛，胃中空虚，客气动膈，短气，躁烦，心中懊憹，阳气内陷，心下因鞭，则为结胸，大陷胸汤主之。若不结胸，但头汗出，余处无汗，剂颈而还，小便不利，身必发黄。五苓散主之。"}]},{"ID":"20230927143339-cv4ijkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143339-cv4ijkw","updated":"20230927143339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陷胸汤方：大黄六两、芒硝一升，甘遂一钱匙；"}]},{"ID":"20230927143339-2jzt6oq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143339-2jzt6oq","updated":"20230927143339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右三味，以水六升，先煮大黄，煮二升，去滓，纳芒硝，煮二沸，纳甘遂末，温服一升，得快利，止后服。"}]}]}